#. type: TH
#: condinapt-minios.7:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "MiniOS CondinAPT Integration"
msgstr "Intégration CondinAPT pour MiniOS"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:6
msgid "condinapt-minios - use CondinAPT in MiniOS build modules"
msgstr ""
"condinapt-minios - utiliser CondinAPT dans les modules de construction MiniOS"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:11
msgid ""
"MiniOS modules use \\f[B]condinapt\\f[R](1) to select and install APT "
"packages from the active build configuration.  This page documents the "
"MiniOS staging paths, module layout, and standard filter map.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Les modules MiniOS utilisent \\f[B]condinapt\\f[R](1) pour sélectionner et "
"installer des paquets APT à partir de la configuration de construction "
"active.  Cette page documente les chemins de staging MiniOS, la structure "
"des modules et la carte de filtrage standard.\\fR"

#. type: SH
#: condinapt-minios.7:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "MODULE INTEGRATION"
msgstr "INTÉGRATION DES MODULES"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:14
msgid ""
"The builder discovers modules through the selected environment directory:"
msgstr ""
"Le constructeur détecte les modules via le répertoire d'environnement "
"sélectionné :"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "linux-live/environments/E<lt>desktopE<gt>/\n"
msgstr "linux-live/environments/E<lt>desktopE<gt>/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:20
msgid "Entries there are normally links to reusable module sources under:"
msgstr ""
"Les entrées présentes sont normalement des liens vers des sources de modules "
"réutilisables situées sous :"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "linux-live/scripts/E<lt>NN-module-nameE<gt>/\n"
msgstr "linux-live/scripts/E<lt>NN-module-nameE<gt>/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:32
msgid ""
"During the install stage, the builder copies the module\\[cq]s "
"\\f[B]install\\f[R] script to \\f[B]/install\\f[R] in the chroot.  It also "
"stages \\f[B]condinapt\\f[R], \\f[B]condinapt.map\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]packages.list\\f[R], and the generated build configuration at the "
"chroot root.  Do not rely on \\f[B]$CWD\\f[R] or an installed \\f[B]/usr/"
"share/minios-live\\f[R] path from inside a module script.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Lors de l'étape d'installation, le constructeur copie le script "
"\\f[B]install\\f[R] du module vers \\f[B]/install\\f[R] dans le chroot.  Il "
"place également \\f[B]condinapt\\f[R], \\f[B]condinapt.map\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]packages.list\\f[R] et la configuration de construction générée à la "
"racine du chroot.  Ne vous fiez pas à \\f[B]$CWD\\f[R] ou à un chemin \\f[B]/"
"usr/share/minios-live\\f[R] installé depuis un script de module.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:34
msgid "A minimal \\f[B]install\\f[R] script is:\\fR"
msgstr "Un script \\f[B]install\\f[R] minimal est :\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"set -e\n"
"set -o pipefail\n"
"set -u\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"set -e\n"
"set -o pipefail\n"
"set -u\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\&. /minioslib || exit 1\n"
"\\&. /minios_build.conf || exit 1\n"
msgstr ""
"\\&. /minioslib || exit 1\n"
"\\&. /minios_build.conf || exit 1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SCRIPT_DIR=\\[dq]$(dirname \\[dq]$(readlink -f \\[dq]$0\\[dq])\\[dq])\\[dq]\n"
"/condinapt \\[rs]\n"
"    -l \\[dq]${SCRIPT_DIR}/packages.list\\[dq] \\[rs]\n"
"    -c \\[dq]${SCRIPT_DIR}/minios_build.conf\\[dq] \\[rs]\n"
"    -m \\[dq]${SCRIPT_DIR}/condinapt.map\\[dq]\n"
msgstr ""
"SCRIPT_DIR=\\[dq]$(dirname \\[dq]$(readlink -f \\[dq]$0\\[dq])\\[dq])\\[dq]\n"
"/condinapt \\ \n"
"    -l \\[dq]${SCRIPT_DIR}/packages.list\\[dq] \\ \n"
"    -c \\[dq]${SCRIPT_DIR}/minios_build.conf\\[dq] \\ \n"
"    -m \\[dq]${SCRIPT_DIR}/condinapt.map\\[dq]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:52
msgid "The standard module may contain:"
msgstr "Le module standard peut contenir :"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:64
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"NN-module-name/\n"
"|-- packages.list\n"
"|-- install\n"
"|-- skip_conditions.conf       # optional\n"
"|-- rootcopy-install/          # optional\n"
"|-- build                      # optional\n"
"|-- patches/                   # optional, used by build\n"
"|-- is_dkms_build              # optional DKMS marker\n"
"|-- rootcopy-postinstall/      # optional\n"
"\\[ga]-- postinstall                # optional\n"
msgstr ""
"NN-module-name/\n"
"|-- packages.list\n"
"|-- install\n"
"|-- skip_conditions.conf       # optionnel\n"
"|-- rootcopy-install/          # optionnel\n"
"|-- build                      # optionnel\n"
"|-- patches/                   # optionnel, utilisé par build\n"
"|-- is_dkms_build              # marqueur DKMS optionnel\n"
"|-- rootcopy-postinstall/      # optionnel\n"
"\\[ga]-- postinstall                # optionnel\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:69
msgid ""
"See \\f[B]linux-live/scripts/10-example/README.md\\f[R] for the complete "
"module lifecycle, ownership manifests, naming, and environment-link "
"instructions.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Consultez \\f[B]linux-live/scripts/10-example/README.md\\f[R] pour le cycle "
"de vie complet d'un module, les manifestes de propriété, les conventions de "
"nommage et les instructions de liaison d'environnement.\\fR"

